<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#Sx2.SSx2.SSSx3.Px9" title="In Meta-Imitation Learning Objective ‣ Linear Velocity Feedback Delay Mitigation ‣ Acknowledgments ‣ RAPTOR: A Foundation Policy for Quadrotor Control" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Note</span></a></li>
