This package <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib50" title="" class="ltx_ref">50</a>]</cite> contains all training and inference code as well as the complete pre-training data (including dynamics parameters and checkpoints of the <math id="Sx2.SSx2.SSSx3.Px10.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="1000" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>1000</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">1000</annotation></semantics></math> quadrotors) and the resulting foundation policy. Please refer to the readme.txt for instructions.</p>
</div>
